SUMMARY:Historic Shepherdstown Speaker Series - Historical Memory of Frontier War in 20th Century Shenandoah Family Histories - Dr. Ben Bankhurst
ORGANIZATION:Shepherd University
LOCATION:Shepherd Univ - Byrd Center for Congressional History and Education
DESCRIPTION:<p>Dr. Ben Bankhurst of Shepherd University will kick off Historic Shepherdstown's 2026 Speaker Series. Dr. Bankhurst is the Director of the Center for Appalachian Studies and the Ray and Madeleine Professor of American History.\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Shepherd Univ - Byrd Center for Congressional History and Education\, 213 North King Street\, Shepherdstown\, WV\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Suprena Mills 304-876-0910 hsc1786@gmail.com</p
CATEGORIES:Community & Civic, Family & Kids, History
URL:https://historicshepherdstown.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
