SUMMARY:April Showers Jigsaw Joust
ORGANIZATION:Game Knights
LOCATION:Game Knights
DESCRIPTION:<p>SPEED PUZZLING CONTEST\nSaturday\, April 18\, 2026\n10:00 - 12:15 Solo Competition at 400 South Princess Street\n12:30 - 2:45 Team (3/4 ppl) Competition at 113 South Princess Street\nPrizes for 1st through 3rd place in each category.\nAll registrants receive a $5 gift certificate to Game Knights.\nTake home your 500-piece contest puzzle!\nLight refreshments provided.\n$25 solo registration\n$65 team registration\nRegistration is open now! https://square.link/u/qilrOEat\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Game Knights\, 400 South Princess Street\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, USA\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> The Shopkeep 681-534-1047 shopkeep@gameknightsshepherdstown.com</p
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture, Film & Performing Arts
URL:https://square.link/u/qilrOEat
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
