SUMMARY:2026 Opening of Historic Shepherdstown Museum
ORGANIZATION:Historic Shepherdstown & Museum
LOCATION:Historic Shepherdstown Museum at the Entler Hotel
DESCRIPTION:<p>The Historic Shepherdstown Museum reopens for its 2026 season with a community ribbon cutting at 11 am. New exhibits include a recently acquired and rare 35 star US flag when West Virginia became a state\, and artifacts from the Battle of Shepherdstown that have not previously been on public display.\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Historic Shepherdstown Museum at the Entler Hotel\, 129 East German Street\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, United States\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Suprena Mills 304-876-0910 hsc1786@gmail.com</p
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture, Community & Civic, History
URL:https://historicshepherdstown.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260426T130000Z-9ab97ca0-db46-5adc-8f82-8a4db817cfff@shepherdstown.info
DTSTAMP:20260413T160102Z
DTSTART:20260426T130000Z
DTEND:20260426T160000Z
SUMMARY:USGS Eastern Ecological Science Center Earth Day Open House
ORGANIZATION:USGS Eastern Ecological Science Center
LOCATION:USGS Eastern Ecological Science Center, 11649 Leetown Road, Kearneysville
DESCRIPTION:<p>The center will be hosting a free open house and Earth Day celebration\, inviting the community to engage with scientists and nature. The day will feature hands-on exhibits\, crafts\, interactive science demonstrations and live animals\, offering something for all ages. Demonstrations will highlight ongoing research and activities at the USGS center. Visitors can create art from recycled materials\, learn about amphibians\, birds and fish\; discover the importance of bees in backyards and experience a bug bonanza. Additional activities include how to track genetics\; appearances by diving ducks\; a photo zone and more. Join us for an afternoon of fun!\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> USGS Eastern Ecological Science Center\, 11649 Leetown Road\, Kearneysville\, WV\, 25430\, USA\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Casey Knapp 2407862599 cknapp@usgs.gov</p
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture, Holidays & Fairs
URL:https://www.usgs.gov/centers/eesc/eesc-upcoming-events
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
