SUMMARY:Annual Garden Club Plant Sale
ORGANIZATION:Trinity Episcopal Church
LOCATION:Trinity Episcopal Church
DESCRIPTION:<p>Potomac-Meckenburg Garden Club’s annual plant sale\, featuring perennials and shrubs from member’s gardens plus colorful annuals and hanging baskets. Proceeds support the club’s scholarship fund and community projects. Come early for best selection!\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Trinity Episcopal Church\, W German St\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, US\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Esther Murphy 7039803928 esther_murphy@comcast.net</p
CATEGORIES:Community & Civic, Outdoors & Nature
URL:https://pmgardenclub.org/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260502T090000Z-7d8e3315-8e06-5588-9a18-b2fa55409946@shepherdstown.info
DTSTAMP:20260413T160102Z
DTSTART:20260502T090000Z
DTEND:20260502T120000Z
SUMMARY:Spring Plant Sale
ORGANIZATION:Trinity Episcopal Church
LOCATION:Trinity Episcopal Church
DESCRIPTION:<p>May 2 2026 Plant Sale!\nLocation: Trinity Episcopal Churchyard\, 210 West German Street\, Shepherdstown\nTime: 9am–noon\, rain or shine\nCash or check only.\nThe PMGC plant sale includes many locally favorite plants at affordable prices. Our annual sale tends to be quite popular\, so come early to get the best selection\, or come at the end to get in our half-price deals!\nThe sale features perennials\, herbs\, natives\, and deer-resistant plants and shrubs. We offer gardening advice and plant identification.\nAll proceeds benefit and support our our ongoing projects\, such as our student scholarship fund\, garden books\, civic beautification\, and yearbook printing. This annual fundraiser helps to keep our garden club fiscally healthy and robust.\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Trinity Episcopal Church\, W German St\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, US\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Yocencia Deal 304-283-4258 yocencia@gmail.com</p
CATEGORIES:Uncategorized
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
